{
  "name": "Lung Cancer (European Calibration)",
  "remarks": [
    "=======================================================================",
    "SYNTHEA MODULE: Lung Cancer (NSCLC + SCLC) — European Epidemiology",
    "=======================================================================",
    "Calibrated against:",
    "  - ECIS / IARC GLOBOCAN 2020: Europe-specific incidence rates",
    "  - ECDC Cancer Burden report 2022",
    "  - ERS European Lung Cancer Report 2022",
    "  - ESMO Clinical Practice Guidelines: Lung Cancer 2023",
    "  - GBD 2019: Tracheal, bronchus, and lung cancer — Europe",
    "",
    "Key calibration data (ECIS/GLOBOCAN 2020 — Europe):",
    "  Age-standardised incidence rate: ~36 per 100,000 (both sexes)",
    "  Male ASR: ~48/100,000; Female ASR: ~25/100,000 (rising)",
    "  Cumulative risk to age 75: ~4.1% males, ~2.1% females",
    "  5-year prevalence: ~0.5% of total population",
    "  NSCLC: ~85% of cases; SCLC: ~15%",
    "  Stage at diagnosis: Stage III-IV in ~70% (late detection)",
    "",
    "Age-specific incidence per 100,000/year (ECIS 2020):",
    "  45-49 years :  ~12",
    "  50-54 years :  ~30",
    "  55-59 years :  ~62",
    "  60-64 years : ~110",
    "  65-69 years : ~155",
    "  70-74 years : ~185",
    "  75-79 years : ~200",
    "R4 (2026-08-29): LC_CT_Scan was malformed and crashed patient generation.",
    "The module itself was always loaded and correct.",
    "R5 (2026-09-30): the module had NO Death state. Stage-specific excess mortality",
    "added; survivors no longer accumulate for ever. Predicted against ECIS EU-27",
    "complete prevalence: 55-64 -19%, 65-74 -9%, 75+ +19%, where R4 measured +123%,",
    "+184% and +588%. Also note the European reference figure for this module: ECIS",
    "gives 0.1797% of the total population for all ages, not the 0.5% carried in the",
    "R4 verification table, which was a 5-year prevalence quoted as a complete one."
  ],
  "states": {
    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Age_Guard"
    },
    "Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 45,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Lung_Cancer_Annual_Check"
    },
    "Lung_Cancer_Annual_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 50,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_45_49"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 55,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_50_54"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 60,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_55_59"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 65,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_60_64"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 70,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_65_69"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 75,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "LC_Prob_70_74"
        },
        {
          "transition": "LC_Prob_75_plus"
        }
      ]
    },
    "LC_Prob_45_49": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Annual incidence 0.012%. ECIS 2020 rate 12/100,000/year."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.00012,
          "transition": "LC_Type_Branch"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.99988,
          "transition": "LC_Annual_Delay"
        }
